<!doctype html>
<html><head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
{{if not (or .Expired .RetryIn)}}<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="5;url=/pair?auto=1">{{end}}
<title>Pair WhatsApp</title>
<style>body{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:32rem;margin:4rem auto;padding:0 1rem}</style>
</head><body>
<h1>Pair WhatsApp</h1>
{{if or .Expired .RetryIn}}
<p><strong>The pairing session expired.</strong> WhatsApp closes an unused pairing session after a few minutes.</p>
{{if .RetryIn}}<p>A new session can start in {{.RetryIn}} seconds: reload this page then.</p>{{else}}<p><a href="/pair">Start a new pairing session</a></p>{{end}}
{{else}}
<p>Open WhatsApp on your phone &rarr; <em>Settings</em> &rarr; <em>Linked Devices</em> &rarr; <em>Link a Device</em>, then scan:</p>
<p><img src="/pair/qr.png" alt="WhatsApp pairing QR"></p>
<p><small>This page auto-refreshes every 5 seconds while the QR rotates.</small></p>
{{end}}
<hr>
<p>Or pair without scanning: enter your phone number (country code first) and type the code into WhatsApp via <em>Link with phone number instead</em>.</p>
<form method="post" action="/pair/code">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="+919876543210" inputmode="tel" required>
<button type="submit">Get pairing code</button>
</form>
</body></html>
